{"id":"9a1bb1aaf7f1b6c3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornclosureimp.md","title":"Pure Horn implication by logical closure","display":"thm-hornclosureimp — Pure Horn implication by logical closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornclosureimp","aliases":["27-thm-hornclosureimp"],"display":"thm-hornclosureimp — Pure Horn implication by logical closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornclosure]]","[[27-df-impset]]","[[27-df-litset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornclosureimp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornclosureimp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornclosureimp — Pure Horn implication by logical closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,N\\subseteq[n]\">\\(P,N\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\cap N=\\varnothing\">\\(P\\cap N=\\varnothing\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\{x_i:i\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in N\\}}\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;N\\cap\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,P)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\{x_i:i\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in N\\}}\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;N\\cap\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,P)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.4.2, Lemma 6.3，印刷页 285，PDF 第 309 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对证明：若交闭包与 N 不交，最小假点支持 HornCl(f,P) 自身给反例；若存在交点，每个包含 P 的假点都在 N 至少一个位置为一，因而不满足该项。正项 N=∅ 永远不是 pure Horn 函数的蕴涵项，边界吻合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-impset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $P,N\\subseteq[n]$, $P\\cap N=\\varnothing$; $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Imp}$ are defined in [[27-df-term]] and [[27-df-impset]]; $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornclosure]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $P,N\\subseteq[n]$, $P\\cap N=\\varnothing$; $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Imp}$ are defined in [[27-df-term]] and [[27-df-impset]]; $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornclosure]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $P,N\\subseteq[n]$, $P\\cap N=\\varnothing$; $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Imp}$ are defined in [[27-df-term]] and [[27-df-impset]]; $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornclosure]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n","display":false},{"tex":"P,N\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"P\\cap N=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\{x_i:i\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in N\\}}\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;N\\cap\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,P)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1285,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornclosureimp|thm-hornclosureimp — Pure Horn implication by logical closure]]"}],"outgoing":["866e5085ffe52570","e9e30bad3bbd56ff","8311e93eaac6c631","5d10aed668d85817","e065076d6b51508e"]}